A clear explanation of the services requested and the services actually received? {color:#ff5630}Recruitment of temporary mechanics to fix our fleet of scooters. Since June we already employed 8 workers via Arpi.{color}
Did they manage these people or just recruit them? How was it agreed that the fee would be calculated? {color:#ff5630}T&Cs are stated in the contract I sent you. Arpi has contracts signed with each of these mechanics that we employed via Arpi. We recruit them and Arpi manages them.{color}

* Explanation of what the cost is that they are requesting now and what basis they are claiming (are they relying on the contract? Did the contract have some set term?)
{color:#ff5630}The cost is divided between interest (200NOK) and collection fee (4000NOK). Local law -{color}[https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/1976-12-17-100|https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/1976-12-17-100]{color:#ff5630} argues for compensations up to 40 euros - When the creditor can claim interest on arrears pursuant to § 2, the creditor may also demand compensation from the debtor for recovery costs corresponding to 40 euros. In our case, they are claiming 400 euros. The contract I sent you earlier this week is framed under {color}[https://www.htu.no/kunder/htu/htuen.nsf/($All)/9D6D2285A0AC0F00C1257A53005756E7?OpenDocument&qnfl=print|https://www.htu.no/kunder/htu/htuen.nsf/($All)/9D6D2285A0AC0F00C1257A53005756E7?OpenDocument&qnfl=print] and the above clauses.

* Is Lindorff the service provider or some external collection agreement?{color:#ff5630} External collection service{color}
