* Attempting to configure multiple backends with single location in nginx
* This works with 2 simple test sites (see test case below)
* When trying with the 2 desired targets (orchestrator 3000 + vtctld 15000), only one site works properly, whichever one is configured under nginx "location /".  The second site will not work with other location (eg: /orc or /vtc). I suspect due to 302 redirects.

