Known steps to force chat connection to be lost:

* wait for successful connection opening, lock device and then unlock it after several (~15) seconds - I have noticed that connection is not always lost in this case;
* wait for successful connection opening, move app to background and then move it back to foreground after 1,5 minutes;
* wait for successful connection opening, turn Network Link Conditioner with 100% Loss profile on, then return to the app and wait for socket to be closed by timeout;
* wait for successful connection opening, turn on Airplane mode and return to the app.

