Hi All\! 

We have received back the memo from the SW law firm on the status of our batteries as DG’s. You will find the memo attached here for your own review. 

[^Legal Opinion on Scooter Batteries as DG.pdf]

❗ *In summary:*

* There are EU-level requirements to ensure our internal teams and external contractors receive training and guidance on handling these DG’s. There are also requirements for the packing and storage of DG on a EU level. Dougie is working on creating a process for all of this and will be rolling it out shortly to regional and country leads for implementation;
* There are no SW-specific requirements or licenses needed. Everything covered in Swedish law is covered in our EU wide obligations for which review and process alignment by Dougie highlighted above;
* On a group level, Bolt does need to appoint a “Security Advisor” and they need to get certified with a test. This is also a work in progress on the side of Dougie;
* Going forward (and looking at existing relationships) there are certain “standard terms” that Dougie will be recommending for our agreements with external contractors who transport/store the scooters. This may require the amendment of existing relationships. He will be providing clarity on this and a rollout plan to regional and country leads shortly. 

In closing, there are *no imidate action points for local teams to be actioning*. There are many action points that Dougie is working on and will be communicated in due time to regional and country leads. 👌 

I hope that this update serves to adequately address your concerns and provides you clarity on the next steps that will be to come. As Dougie will be following up with regional scooter managers in due time to roll out the amended storage and transport process/training mentioned above, I will be closing this ticket as work for legal here is complete. If after reading the above and attached you have further questions for *Dougie*, these can be raised in slack. However, should you have further questions for *legal* after reading the above summary and attached memo please feel free to still follow up here and I will get back to you with a response. 👍

