What I believe the reason is that sometimes the {{payment_info}} is {{null}}

According to the server code in {{ClientService.ts}} (/src/rides/marketplace/order/main/client/service/ClientService.ts)

method {{getPaymentInfo}} 

{noformat}            const finalPriceResponse = await this.pricingOrderApi.getFinalPrice(ctx, {
