                }
            }).catch((e) => {
                logger.warning(ctx, "Failed to get final price", {order_id: orderId, error_code: BoltError.getErrorResponse(e).code});
                return null;
            });{noformat}

Returns null when failed to get final price.

Here is the confirmation that we do not treat {{null}} appropriately:

{noformat}            let json = JSON([
